## Summary

**PRIMARY RULE**: All PRs must follow Conventional Commits format and use structured templates.

**Key Requirements:**

1. Title: Conventional Commits format
2. Labels: 3-5 labels automatically assigned
3. Body: Follow template structure
4. Task: Link to Notion task
5. Testing: Document testing approach
6. Checklist: Complete before submission

**Remember**: PRs are permanent documentation. Write for clarity and completeness.
